07\t  priority: P1\n108\t  gpu_budget_hours: 2\n109\t  deps:\n110\t  - plan_001\n111\t  registry_id: plan_012_clip_vit_control\n112\t  status: done\n113\t  result: 'CLIP RSA=0.557, R²=0.587. D037 corrected: CLIP < DINO (0.631) in both dimensions.\n114\t    VL pretraining does NOT improve over self-supervised.'\n115\t  note: D037 invalidated 'VL pretraining dominance' interpretation. CLIP < DINO in\n116\t    both RSA and R².\n117\t- id: plan_013\n118\t  claim:\n119\t  - 1\n120\t  description: Branch-split RSA — 从 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 分离 DINOv2 branch (1088d)\n121\t    vs SigLIP branch (1088d) RSA，定量回答 fused backbone 中各组件对 action-aligned geometry\n122\t    的贡献\n123\t  priority: P0\n124\t  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n125\t  deps:\n126\t  - plan_001\n127\t  - plan_012\n128\t  registry_id: plan_013_branch_split\n129\t  status: done\n130\t  result: DINOv2 branch=0.619 ≈ SigLIP branch=0.621. Fused 2176d=0.634 > either branch.\n131\t    Projector compresses 0.634→0.615. Both branches contribute equally.\n132\t- id: plan_009\n133\t  claim:\n134\t  - 1\n135\t  - 2\n136\t  description: CKA verification — 用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，确保不是指标依赖\n137\t  priority: P2\n138\t  gpu_budget_hours: 0\n139\t  deps:\n140\t  - plan_001\n141\t  registry_id: plan_009_cka_verification\n142\t  status: done\n143\t  result: 'PARTIAL: CKA ordering reversal vs RSA (untrained > trained > projector\n144\t    > DINO). Hypothesis partially negated — CKA does NOT replicate RSA ordering. But\n145\t    dissociation itself is a finding: RSA=geometric alignment (LLM degrades), CKA=global\n146\t    structure (LLM preserves). last_preaction CKA=0.127 highest.'\n147\t  note: CPU-only. RSA-CKA dissociation = new finding. Claim 2 must scope as 'geometric\n148\t    degradation'.\n149\t- id: plan_010\n150\t  claim:\n151\t  - 1\n152\t  - 2\n153\t  - 3\n154\t  description: LIBERO-Spatial benchmark 扩展 — 第三个 benchmark 交叉验证\n155\t  priority: P2\n156\t  gpu_budget_hours: 4\n157\t  deps: []\n158\t  registry_id: plan010_action_probe_s