an_id`: reference to plan_XXX\n  - `description`: detailed description\n  - `expected_results`: predicted outcomes (dictionary)\n  - `result_rationale`: explanation of why these results are expected\n  - `tables`: array with title, rows/columns structure\n  - `figures_description`: array of figure descriptions\n  - `analysis`: narrative analysis section\n\n### Experiment Data Files\nAccompanying each tier prediction are actual experiment data snapshots:\n- Format: JSON arrays containing experiment metadata\n- Locations: `dream_reports/dream_YYYYMMDDTHHMMSS/{best|median|worst}/experiment_data.json`\n- Structure: Array of experiment objects with nested results, tables, figures, and analysis sections\n\nAll files are in `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/` directory."}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"506abc2d-d23e-45e9-955e-d6d2abc337cb","uuid":"4e13a975-9cf6-4b35-aebf-64016e5c06fd","timestamp":"2026-05-22T02:51:21.038Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Search the directory /home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15 for any files related to experiment plans, particularly looking for files that define planned experiments with status \"planned\" or \"PLANNED\". Check for YAML files, markdown files, or any configuration that lists experiments. Also look for any existing worst-tier prediction files to understand the expected format. Search breadth: medium.","agentId":"a89d839776df52aa2","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Summary of Findings\n\nI've completed a comprehensive search of the directory for experiment plans and worst-tier prediction files. Here's what I found:\n\n### Main Experiment Plan File\n**Primary location:** `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/experiment_plan.yaml`\n\nThis is the master experiment plan containing 13 experiments (plan_001 through plan_013, plus plan_010 for spatial benchmark). Status summary:\n- **Done:** 12 experiments (plan_001-009, plan_011-013)\n- **Preparing:** 1 experiment (plan_010 - LIBERO-Spatial benchmark extension)\n\n### Planned/Preparing Experiments\nOnly **one** experiment has a status other than \"done\":\n- **plan_010**: LIBERO-Spatial benchmark expansion\n  - Status: `preparing`\n  - Priority: P2\n  - GPU budget: 4 hours\n  - Note: \"Director approved startup. Data download + disk cleanup in progress.\"\n\n### Worst-Tier Prediction Files (Best Format Reference)\nThe directory contains comprehensive \"dream reports\" with worst-tier predictions in YAML format:\n\n**Latest dream reports (most comprehensive):**\n- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T011810/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml` (newest)\n- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T011810/best/imagined_experiments.yaml`\n- `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260515T222933/worst/imagined_experiments.yaml`\n\n### Worst-Tier Prediction File Format\nThe `imagined_experiments.yaml` files contain:\n- `tier`: \"worst\", \"best\", or \"median\"\n- `narrative_guidance`: High-level impact description in Chinese\n- `imagined_experiments`: Array of experiment objects with:\n  - `name`: experiment name\n  - `plan_id`: reference to plan_XXX\n  - `description`: detailed description\n  - `expected_results`: predicted outcomes (dictionary)\n  - `result_rationale`: explanation of why these results are expected\n  - `tables`: array with title, rows/columns structure\n  - `figures_description`: array of figure descriptions\n  - `analysis`: narrative analysis section\n\n### Experiment Data Files\nAccompanying each tier prediction are actual experiment data snapshots:\n- Format: JSON arrays containing experiment metadata\n- Locations: `dream_reports/dream_YYYYMMDDTHHMMSS/{best|median|worst}/experiment_data.json`